<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39023" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίγειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>on</i> or <i>of the
				earth, terrestrial</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῷα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					546a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βροτοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.1571
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόγειος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Par.</u>
				1.3043
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>creeping</i>, of plants, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.18.6
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				6.2.2
			</span></i>, al.; but <i>land</i>-plants, opp. water-plants, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				681a21
			</span></i>; <i>living on the ground</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρνιθες], τετράποδα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HA</u>
				633b1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PA</u>
				657b24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. neut. pl.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίγεια</span>
			<i>ground-floor</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύργος
			διώρυφος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				2p.20
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίγειον</span>, τό, misspelling of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίγυον</span>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				80
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				426
			</span></i>. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίγαιος</span>.)</div>
